<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">cure-hide</ansi> (tailoring recipe)

Scrape a raw hide (deer, boar or horse) clean and salt it so it stops rotting.
Needs a hide scraper.

